WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.970
<b><i>The Corruption of Qliphoth</i></b>

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:34.990
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:33.850
You're sure this is the right way?

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:36.730
I am tracking the trolls' 
residual mental energy.

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:37.940
I am certain.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.000
Residual?

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.280
Hey, have you picked up any 
other thoughts from them?

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:45.880
Nothing yet.

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:49.390
I keep calling to them, but they 
seem to be unconscious.

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:50.960
But it's all right.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.530
As long as they have the silver shirts,

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:57.040
the trolls cannot touch them directly.

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:01.510
Wait.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:06.400
Leave this to me.

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:12.790
Wh-What was that face?

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:13.540
Face?!

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:14.660
Boo...

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.290
It is as I feared.

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:18.470
This is the astral realm.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.040
And not a good part.

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:23.550
This is Qliphoth, the territory of 
darkness, in the astral realm.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.400
This would normally be impossible.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:31.300
The astral and physical realms 
shouldn't overlap to this extent.

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:35.870
Now that my eyes have adjusted, 
I'm seeing all kinds of weird crap.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:36.730
Yeah.

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:37.560
This way.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.520
The trolls' lair is back here.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:43.760
This place seems even worse.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.540
I shall try to call them again.

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:53.940
<i>Casca...</i>

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.280
Where are we?

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.360
Casca!

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.470
<i>Farnese! Casca!</i>

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.700
Schierke!

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:17.830
<i>Good, I finally got through!</i>

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.580
<i>Are you two all right?</i>

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:20.810
Yes.

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:22.530
By the way, where are we?

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:23.780
The air is so stagnant...

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:31.970
What's wrong?

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:34.680
Farnese's od was suddenly disrupted!

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.250
It seems the things around 
her surprised her.

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.850
Let's hurry!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.670
<i>Farnese, calm down.</i>

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:47.170
<i>As long as you have the silver 
shirts, you'll be unharmed.</i>

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.010
You can say that, but...

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.850
Casca, climb!

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:52.850
Hurry!

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:01.970
<i>Are you all right?</i>

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.820
Yes... It was nothing.

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:07.960
Nothing at all.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:15.390
<i>I am wielding a blade for 
another's protection...</i>

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:28.490
<i>Calm down!</i>

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:29.900
<i>Stay where you are.</i>

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:31.340
<i>Don't attract their attention!</i>

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:43.150
Help... Help me...

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.680
No, stop...

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:55.990
Um...

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.670
No!

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:09.920
Oh, no!

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:10.950
What's wrong?

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.850
The trolls found them!

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:13.960
We must hurry!

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.060
Stop.

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:18.270
I shall fool their od.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.010
Now.

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:23.980
Wow.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.310
What's going on?

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:27.900
Controlling od is part of being a mage.

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:30.070
Any mage can do it.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:31.520
Sounds convenient.

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:33.500
Even a thief could learn a lot, right?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.490
It sounds really useful!

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:37.530
<i>Casca!</i>

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:51.180
<i>I just want to crouch and 
curl into a ball...</i>

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:54.820
No!

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:56.740
Stay behind me!

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:04.020
<i>But her warmth on my back 
will not permit that!</i>

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:07.420
<i>I'm helpless, and this is the first time</i>

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:10.020
<i>I've been entrusted with 
someone weaker than I.</i>

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:13.740
<i>Her eyes that know and 
understand nothing</i>

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:16.820
<i>refuse to let me be that way!</i>

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:19.960
<i>Is this punishment or...</i>

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.170
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.850
Guts!

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:45.740
You okay?

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:47.280
Y-Yes!

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:48.980
Where is Serpico?

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:50.850
Too hurt to move.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.640
He's in no danger of dying.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.070
I promised to bring you back.

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:59.570
Enoch villagers, we're here to save you!

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:01.440
We must leave immediately.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.600
Follow me.

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:03.920
Help us...

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:05.330
Are we going to be saved?

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:07.650
Wait, the children are here!

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.090
Hurry!

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:13.760
There are still so many.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:16.090
More than attacked the village!

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:18.240
I'll hold them off.

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:20.780
You take the villagers and go!

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:23.390
No! You cannot handle all these,

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:26.100
not without magical reinforcement!

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:27.350
You'll die, seriously!

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:29.020
Leave it to me!

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:33.880
Take care of Casca.

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:34.640
Yes.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:35.610
Farnese...

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:38.940
You've really helped me out.

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:41.250
I'm grateful.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.120
No, I...

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.450
Let us go.

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:50.690
Isidoro...

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:53.450
Light the string poking out of it,

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.660
count to three, and throw 
it at the enemy.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:56.760
It'll explode.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.680
You're the rearguard.

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:00.160
Protect the women.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.650
But I...

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:02.980
Get going!

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:05.430
There's no time to waste talking.

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:06.740
On the battlefield,

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:09.730
with a weapon, even a kid is a 
force to be reckoned with.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:11.760
I can count on you, 
so I'm counting on you.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:12.960
Don't screw it up.

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:17.470
Fine! I'll do this!

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:20.220
Same to you! Don't die!

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:23.560
Now... Let's get started.

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:37.130
Look at 'em, crawling out...

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:38.830
They're like cockroaches.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:40.840
I've got no choice.

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:43.810
Guess I'll go for a hundred 
consecutive kills of men...

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:46.310
no, animals once more!

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.540
You're hungry, right? Come on.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:55.150
Half of you are about to be prey.

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:58.320
Hurry, everyone!

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.880
One... two... three!

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:06.220
Nice!

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.990
You're perfect for this!

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:14.680
Hang in there!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.100
Come on, stand up!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.280
What's wrong?

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.280
Nothing!

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:31.290
Let's go.

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:53.440
Stop!

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:55.610
What's wrong?

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:56.730
We're surrounded.

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:57.950
Thirteen in front.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.160
Seven behind.

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:02.240
You can't distract them like before?

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:03.740
Not this many!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:07.220
We cannot erect a shield 
and stop moving.

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:08.530
We'll break through!

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:10.220
I'll handle the front.

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:11.960
Isidoro, you take the rear.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:14.920
Seven at once? Fine!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.010
This is your big moment!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.980
Go! Go!

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:19.230
<i>I don't have time to cast a big spell.</i>

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:20.510
<i>They're here!</i>

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:21.900
<i>What?</i>

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.760
<i>Something approaches 
at incredible speed!</i>

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.900
What the hell?!

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:34.650
What was that?

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:36.030
That's...

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:48.990
I guess this is it...

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:56.760
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:08.250
Everyone, we're almost there!

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:11.360
<i>Guts, everyone has 
made it to the exit.</i>

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:13.440
<i>You hurry and get out, too.</i>

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:15.440
Casca?

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:19.950
<i>That's...</i>

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:21.130
What's wrong?

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.120
Well...

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:27.720
Schierke!

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.230
Now what?

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:31.740
That was...

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:34.710
<i>Guts!</i>

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:37.000
<i>What just happened?</i>

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.290
<i>Guts!</i>

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:56.980
It has been so long since 
I have taken form...

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:59.830
And my body is composed 
of troll intestines?

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:01.490
How disgusting.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:16.950
I missed you, boy.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.380
It's been a while.

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:23.840
No, I have always felt you.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:26.350
In the cave, at the tower.

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:29.230
During countless nights...

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.770
I felt your lamentations.

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:36.150
Now, let me feel it more...

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:39.110
Your rage. Your pain.

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:41.830
Unleash it all!

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.190
I feel so cold...

00:12:46.190 --> 00:12:47.910
This is really bad.

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:50.410
I'm not feeling good, either...

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:54.490
<i>I felt an unnatural flow of od 
from the bottom of the grotto.</i>

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.050
<i>What is happening there?</i>

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:01.550
If we don't hurry, 
the trolls will return.

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:02.920
I have no choice.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:07.050
I shall now perform the spell 
to seal the cave's entrance.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:08.950
Hey, wait!

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:10.180
Guts is still inside!

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.330
There is no time.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.590
If I do not seal this place,

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:18.280
the trolls will surely attack Enoch 
and the other villages again.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:21.860
Guts should hear my 
telepathic messages.

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:26.230
Let's believe that he will return 
by the time the spell activates.

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.180
Yes... This is it.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:33.770
This is what I wanted.

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:39.120
Your soul is suited to Qliphoth.

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:40.750
Your hatred...

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.710
Your pain...

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:46.520
And terror.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:53.720
Now, fight me, struggler.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:58.350
Pierce me with your 
big, thick sword...

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:02.070
Is that impossible for you, human?

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:05.780
Then...

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:11.240
Will you make a sacrifice, 
just as he did?

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:15.870
My...

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.430
How rude.

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:22.370
You shouldn't interrupt a man 
and woman having a tryst.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:27.460
Or will you join us, King?

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.720
Slan, Whore Princess 
of the Uterine Sea.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.510
You were the only one summoned?

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.710
Summoned?

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:39.010
I came here myself.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.820
I desired to see this boy.

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:44.760
You understand, don't you?

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:49.130
This is what the fifth's 
appearance means.

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:52.700
The worlds have already 
started to overlap.

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:55.290
Then, no words are left to say.

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:59.720
This place might as well be my womb.

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:02.540
Rage! Violently!

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.860
Bastard spawn of darkness!

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:14.420
Listen, they can't enter this circle!

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:15.810
So don't go outside!

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:17.190
Look!

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:19.720
Human tools?

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:24.320
Schierke said this shield only 
affects ethereal beings...

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:25.520
What?

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:27.900
Fine!

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:34.580
Come at me, you mad apes!

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:35.920
<i>So heavy...</i>

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:39.000
<i>Like I'm sinking into mud.</i>

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:44.520
Using the law of correspondence 
is most effective...

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:47.220
The power of water spirits in the rain.

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:51.000
The power of earth spirits 
in the ground.

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:54.800
But that also brings danger.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:58.630
If the power is too great 
for the caster,

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:02.040
it may swallow her.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:07.440
The one which requires the 
most caution is darkness.

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:09.280
Do not forget...

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:13.860
When you gaze into the darkness, 
the darkness gazes into you, as well.

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:23.120
Well, Your Majesty?

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:25.840
Are you enjoying yourself?

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:30.130
This is the uterus of darkness.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:34.520
The edge of the underworld, 
where accursed souls take form.

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:37.980
These children will come 
in endless numbers,

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:39.920
like insects from the earth.

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:43.020
The time has come.

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:57.910
Okay! That does it for those 
with human tools!

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.560
That was close...

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:01.300
I've only got one left.

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:01.870
Wanna use this?

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:06.880
It's huge!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:08.720
So that's the boss monkey?

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:10.170
I'll use this to finish it.

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:14.430
Using his own guy as a shield?

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:15.880
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.780
<i>I can't finish him like this.</i>

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.340
<i>Lower... Even lower!</i>

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:43.240
<i>Faster!</i>

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:55.720
Hot.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:58.950
So hot...

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:01.260
It's so hot!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:04.300
The sensation of one's body 
being ripped apart...

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:06.580
But it isn't enough.

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.490
Not even close to enough!

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:10.720
More. I need more.

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:11.990
Stand fast.

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:15.700
With your sword, it is possible.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:20.990
For that sword is forged by the 
malice of thousands of dying souls.

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:22.740
Pierce her!

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:36.110
How wonderful...

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:39.470
My womb is being torn open.

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:42.650
Within, life and death intermingle.

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:45.670
You are the best...

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:57.100
D-Did I win?

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:00.260
Let us meet again,

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.890
my beloved boy.

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:19.130
I did it! I did it!

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:22.200
But you didn't get them all!

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.600
Oh, shit.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:31.930
I am the Lord of Rotting Roots.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.630
Ruler of withered trees 
and polluted mud.

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:40.240
In accordance with my contract 
with the little one,

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:43.850
the trolls who crawl on my body

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:47.020
will become a breeding 
ground for maggots.

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:53.630
Rot.

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:58.310
Bloodlust!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:01.630
Hey, wait!

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.810
You're going to bury Guts, too!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:07.640
<i>Guts, hurry and get out.</i>

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:10.850
What the hell's going on?

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:15.130
These are the aftereffects of her 
forced advent and destruction.

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:20.000
Within this area, life and death
have boiled, turning to chaos.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:24.840
If left unchecked, not only will 
this cave be devoured,

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:26.670
but the entire area.

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:28.250
I've gotta worry about myself...

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.730
The exit's buried!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:33.490
Perhaps it is time to 
test my weapon.

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:39.920
I had planned to use it to bury 
them within the vortex, but...

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:42.990
What are you thinking?

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:45.050
I don't have time for weird magic.

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:52.560
<i>What's that sword?</i>

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:53.840
<i>Wait, I've seen it before.</i>

00:20:56.460 --> 00:21:02.520
Within myself, I forged this blade out 
of Behelits taken from apostles.

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:04.560
This is the Sword of Actuation.

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:06.400
Actuation...

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:20.960
<i>That's...</i>

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:25.720
It's going to catch us!

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:29.230
Shit! It's falling apart!

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:30.170
Hey!

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:32.730
She's working really hard right now!

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:37.720
<i>No... I can't hold it back anymore.</i>

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:39.940
Schierke!

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:41.980
Guts!

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:44.550
Guts?

00:21:45.440 --> 00:21:46.870
What happened?

00:21:46.870 --> 00:21:50.540
I cleaved space to travel 
through another layer.

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:52.240
It is this sword's power.

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:55.020
I don't understand a 
damn thing you say.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:57.280
What's going on?!

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:58.760
How were you behind us?

00:21:58.760 --> 00:22:01.040
I owe him another debt.

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:04.090
Are you okay, Schierke?

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:06.490
Yes, I'm fine.

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:09.270
<i>That knight...</i>

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:11.350
Look.

00:22:36.550 --> 00:22:39.180
Qliphoth has closed?

00:22:39.180 --> 00:22:41.880
Wow... Is this magic, too?

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:44.190
No, it wasn't me.

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:46.170
But now, we finally...

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:42.800
<i>Comrades, huh?</i>

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:50.920
<i>I never thought I'd 
ever find them again.</i>

00:23:56.970 --> 00:24:00.870
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:03.130 --> 00:24:05.920
<b>There's no doubt about it... That's an Apostle.</b>

00:24:08.670 --> 00:24:11.300
<b>It is a very dangerous and powerful charm.</b>

00:24:14.510 --> 00:24:17.640
<b>Band of the Hawk...?!</b>

00:24:19.140 --> 00:24:21.480
<b>Even more reason to be at peace.</b>

00:24:23.920 --> 00:24:28.170
<b><i>Next Episode 
The Berserker Armor</i></b>
